OL,3,GNEWSA'Unsurvivable' punch killed pub
OL,4,Aboss, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub boss died after an "unsurvivable"
OL,7,Fpunch to the neck, a murder trial has
OL,8,Fbeen told.
OL,10,FMatthew O'Gara, who ran The Plough pub
OL,11,Fin Huddlesford, Staffordshire, died in
OL,12,Fhospital two days after the incident at
OL,13,Fthe Ricco and Loren bar on Market
OL,14,FStreet, Lichfield, on 24 May.
OL,16,FBilly Allison, who has admitted
OL,17,Fmanslaughter but denied murder,
OL,18,Fdelivered a "very, very hard" punch
OL,19,Fwith the "stance and skill of an
OL,20,Fexperienced fighter", the jury at
OL,21,FStafford Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
